ted all three Central Parking", "t0": 17.63, "t1": 21.46, "shot": "central-followup", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Central Parking", "source": "2018-q1-followup", "heading": "Controller follow-up", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Recommendations closed", "value": "3"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Follow-up", "event": "2018-12-03"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.64, 0.96, 1.43, 1.55, 2.0, 2.49, 2.77, 3.07, 3.46]}, {"scene": "parking", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "recommendations closed. The table leaves out the posting dates.", "t0": 21.46, "t1": 25.71, "shot": "central-followup-source", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "2018-q1-followup", "text": "City Services Auditor Follow-up on Recommendation Implementation Status – Fiscal Year 2018-19, First Quarter, page 5", "mark": "City Services Auditor Follow-up on Recommendation Implementation Status – Fiscal Year 2018-19, First Quarter, page 5", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller, City Services Auditor"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.86, 2.12, 2.32, 2.7, 3.0, 3.16, 3.26, 3.75]}, {"scene": "parking", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "A different operator, Priority Parking, underpaid $7,027 over the same years.", "t0": 25.83, "t1": 31.87, "shot": "receipt-3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "heading": "Priority Parking–CA", "context": "2015 audit", "source": "priority", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Underpaid rent", "value": "$7,027"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Interest through December 2013", "value": "$1,601"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.57, 1.07, 1.68, 2.3, 2.96, 3.34, 3.78, 4.45, 4.87, 5.08, 5.19, 5.49]}, {"scene": "receipts", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "At Lou’s Pier 47, a health-care surcharge collected from", "t0": 32.09, "t1": 35.78, "shot": "receipt-4", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "heading": "Lou’s Pier 47", "context": "2016 audit", "so