s. The Port also made a base-rent error.", "t0": 69.54, "t1": 73.85, "shot": "receipt-8-source", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "butterfly", "text": "RGN Corporation, operating Butterfly Restaurant, PDF pp. 3, 6, 13", "mark": "RGN Corporation, operating Butterfly Restaurant, PDF pp. 3, 6, 13", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.69, 2.01, 2.21, 2.58, 2.97, 3.22, 3.3, 3.89]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Port collected $5,631. After the tenant left, the Port", "t0": 73.97, "t1": 80.46, "shot": "receipt-9", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "heading": "Collection and interest", "context": "2017 audit", "source": "butterfly", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Principal collected", "value": "$5,631"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Separate interest", "value": "$579"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.45, 0.95, 1.31, 1.84, 2.12, 2.52, 3.15, 4.67, 5.04, 5.15, 5.55, 6.06, 6.21]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "said pursuing the separate $579 interest did not appear cost-effective.", "t0": 80.46, "t1": 86.36, "shot": "receipt-9-source", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "butterfly", "text": "RGN Corporation, operating Butterfly Restaurant, PDF pp. 3, 6, 13", "mark": "RGN Corporation, operating Butterfly Restaurant, PDF pp. 3, 6, 13", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.78, 0.9, 1.35, 1.68, 2.06, 2.7, 3.12, 4.09, 4.35, 4.53, 4.92]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "At the Airport, Travelex reported its revenue according to the", "t0": 86.48, "t1": 89.77, "shot": "receipt-10", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "heading": "Travelex Currency Services", "context": "2019 audit", "source": "travelex", "rows": [{"icon": "document", "label": "Credit corrected", "value": "SFO452219"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.33, 0.88, 1.48, 2.0, 2.21, 2.65, 3.11, 3.21]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[4]"], "text": "lease. The Airport had issued an incorrect credit.", "t0": 89.77, "t1": 93.4, "shot": "receipt-10-source", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "travelex", "text": "Travelex Currency Services, PDF pp. 3, 10", "mark": "Travelex Currency Services, PDF pp. 3, 10", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office"}, "wt": [0.04, 1.12, 1.33, 1.83, 2.01, 2.42, 2.56, 3.12]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The Airport documented the corrective invoice for $40,891.", "t0": 93.52, "t1": 99.81, "shot": "receipt-11", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "heading": "Corrective invoice", "context": "2019 audit", "source": "travelex", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Invoice", "value": "$40,891"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Issued", "value": "May 21, 2019"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.71, 1.31, 1.43, 1.94, 2.44, 2.64, 2.99, 3.61, 3.93, 4.33, 4.97]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The published report gives no cash receipt.", "t0": 99.81, "t1": 102.36, "shot": "receipt-11-source", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "travelex", "text": "Travelex Currency Services, PDF pp. 3, 10", "mark": "Travelex Currency Services, PDF pp. 3, 10", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.24, 0.68, 1.1, 1.4, 1.63, 2.01]}, {"scene": "recovery", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "At Stow Lake Boathouse, late charges and interest exceeded", "t0": 102.48, "t1": 106.05, "shot": "receipt-12", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "heading": "Stow Lake Boathouse", "context": "2018 audit", "source": "boat", "rows": [{"icon": "receipt", "label": "Underpaid rent", "value": "$1,770.61"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Charges and interest", "value": "$5,038.80"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.58, 0.84, 1.49, 1.77, 2.36, 2.55, 3.11]}, {"scene": "recovery", "